# Files Docker does not need to build the images: keeps the build context small and builds fast.
# The dev image (dev-box) uses no project file at all: the project is mounted at /var/www/html.
# The prod image (prod-box) copies composer.*, .htaccess, *.php, framework/, public/, .env and application/.
.git
.github
vendor
**/node_modules
qa
backups
claude-plugin
.claude
*.log
.DS_Store
